=== official sources ledger (US first; comparisons labelled) ===
NOT LEGAL/TAX ADVICE. This script prints a LOCAL ledger; it does NOT fetch URLs.
checked_on = date the author read the page; re-check the official text before relying on it.
[US] sec_15c3_5: 17 CFR 240.15c3-5 Market Access Rule
