[US] reg_sho_201: 17 CFR 242.201 Regulation SHO circuit breaker
    https://www.ecfr.gov/current/title-17/chapter-II/part-242/subject-group-ECFR1607681c7b4f78d/section-242.201
    checked_on=2026-11-04 effective_from=see source status=in force per source text on checked_on
